  "$comment": "Adapter for OpenAI Codex CLI. FINDING (verified Sept 2026): Codex has NO native spawnable per-agent subagents — its primitives are config.toml [profiles] + AGENTS.md instructions + coarse sandbox_mode. So this port is a DIFFERENT shape than OpenCode/Copilot: per-role instruction docs under .codex/agents/<name>.md (TOML +++ frontmatter) used via profiles / manual selection / an external orchestrator, PLUS a generated .codex/config.toml with strong/mid/cheap tier profiles. The panel's writer!=reviewer separation is NOT automatic on Codex. See docs/porting/codex-notes.md. Re-verify model IDs.",
